# Stylized Female Character (Free) – Documentation

## Overview
This is the **free version** of the Stylized Female Character package — a high-quality **stylized female character** designed for real-time applications such as games, cinematics, and simulations.

The free version includes the complete character model with all materials and textures, plus **5 animation clips** and a ready-to-use animator controller. The character is built from **modular skinned meshes** — equipment pieces such as the helmet, weapons, and outfit parts can be enabled or disabled independently.

The **full version** extends this package with 17 animation clips, including jumps, strafes, additional attacks, hit reactions, death, and victory animations.

---

## Render Pipeline Compatibility

This asset is fully compatible with:

- Built-in Render Pipeline (BRP)
- Universal Render Pipeline (URP)
- High Definition Render Pipeline (HDRP)

All materials use a custom **RSG_Lit Shader Graph** that supports all three render pipelines, so a single material set works everywhere — no material swapping required.

