## Setup Instructions

1. Import the package into your Unity project.  
2. Ensure your project is using one of the supported render pipelines (BRP, URP, or HDRP).  
3. Drag and drop the **P_Stylized_Female_Character_Free** prefab into your scene.  
4. Open the preview scene matching your render pipeline to see the character with proper lighting.  
5. To hide equipment pieces (helmet, weapons, etc.), disable the corresponding child mesh objects on the prefab.  

---

## Notes

- The character uses a **Generic rig** (not Humanoid), so Humanoid animation retargeting is not supported out of the box.  
- No blend shapes are included.  
- No LODs are provided.  
- The asset is intended for desktop and high-quality projects due to 4K textures.  
- For the full animation set (17 clips), please check the **full version** of the Stylized Female Character package on the Unity Asset Store.  

